wait 500
expect Grimoire
clean
shot home
tap Spells
expect 2014
tap Filters
tap Class
wait-for Show only
clean
shot spell-class-choices
tap-id filters-next
tap Wizard
expect Wizard
tap School
tap Abjuration
expect Abjuration
clean
shot spell-filters
tap View results
expect Spells
clean
shot spell-results
# A party member's hit points move five at a time, and a spell level holds
# several slots that a long rest gives back.
tap Back
tap-id party
tap-id party-add
type moss
tap-id kb.enter
type 14
tap-id kb.enter
type 20
tap-id kb.enter
type 20
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for moss
tap moss
tap-id hp-down-5
expect 15/20
tap-id next
tap-id slots-setup
tap-id slot-0
tap-id slot-0
tap-id slots-spend
tap-id slot-0
expect 1st · 1 of 2 left
clean
shot party-slots
tap Long rest
expect 1st · 2 of 2 left
# A combatant's hit points may be left blank. Putting the keyboard away at
# that step asks which was meant, and the search lets go on Back.
tap Back
tap Back
tap-id initiative
tap-id init-add
type kobold
tap-id kb.enter
type 9
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for Hit points, or leave blank
tap Back
wait-for Leave hit points blank
clean
shot combatant-blank-hit-points
tap Leave hit points blank
wait-for kobold
